[
  {
    "source": "I will give a statement encouraging the State of Georgia to protect the safety of Mr. King, while criticizing him for participating in these inflammatory and illegal protests.",
    "zh": "我将发表声明，鼓励佐治亚州州保护金先生的安全，同时批评他参与这些煽动性和非法抗议活动。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3766@46/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3766@48/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3766@47/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3766@52/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3766@56/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3766@51/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3766@45/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need more spending and lower interest rates, and we need to repeal the Taft-Hartley Act and put more money into the hands of the American people.",
    "zh": "我们需要更多的支出和更低的利率，我们需要废除《塔夫脱-哈特利法案》并将更多的钱交到美国人民手中。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3767@47/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3767@49/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3767@48/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3767@53/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3767@57/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3767@52/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3767@46/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We must do better. Our present Administration has advocated a hard money policy which caused the recession of 1958 and left idle industrial capacity in our country.",
    "zh": "我们必须做得更好。本届政府提倡硬通货政策，导致1958年经济衰退，并导致我国工业产能闲置。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3768@48/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3768@50/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3768@49/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3768@54/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3768@58/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3768@53/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3768@47/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We are on the right track economically. We can't deny that there was a recession in 1958, but the recovery has been strong and 1960 will see a very high rate of growth in this country.",
    "zh": "我们的经济正走在正确的轨道上。我们不能否认1958年出现了经济衰退，但复苏势头强劲，1960年这个国家将出现非常高的增长率。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3769@49/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3769@51/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3769@50/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3769@55/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3769@59/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3769@54/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3769@48/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The Eisenhower Administration has unfortunately failed to take any real action in undoing the excesses of the New Deal. I would like to see a more conservative Administration in power.",
    "zh": "不幸的是，艾森豪威尔政府未能采取任何实际行动来消除新政的过度行为。我希望看到一个更加保守的政府执政。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3770@50/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3770@52/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3770@51/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3770@56/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3770@60/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3770@55/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3770@49/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I support this measure, and believe it would be greatly beneficial to millions of American workers.",
    "zh": "我支持这项措施，并相信这将对数百万美国工人大有裨益。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3771@51/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3771@53/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3771@52/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3771@56/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3771@50/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Our current minimum wage is sufficient in my opinion. The minimum wage is a necessary expedient but we shouldn't be increasing it so much that we cause unemployment.",
    "zh": "我认为我们目前的最低工资已经足够了。最低工资是必要的权宜之计，但我们不应该提高太多，以免造成失业。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3772@52/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3772@54/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3772@53/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3772@57/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3772@51/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe a minimum wage is at the very least a bad economic idea, and possibly unconstitutional. I do not support this increase.",
    "zh": "我认为最低工资至少是一个糟糕的经济想法，而且可能违宪。我不支持这种增加。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3773@53/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3773@55/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3773@54/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3773@58/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3773@52/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "The last thing we need is a return to excesses and witch-hunts of the early 1950s. We need to keep ourselves focused on the external Communist threat.",
    "zh": "我们最不需要的就是回到 20 世纪 50 年代初的过度行为和政治迫害。我们需要将注意力集中在外部的共产主义威胁上。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3774@54/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3774@56/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3774@55/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3774@59/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3774@53/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We should always be concerned about internal subversion, but the external Soviet threat should be our primary focus at this point.",
    "zh": "我们应该始终关注内部颠覆，但外部苏联威胁应该是我们此时的首要关注点。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3775@55/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3775@57/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3775@56/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3775@60/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3775@54/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "It's unfortunate that we've become less vigilant on the internal Communist threat in recent years. Espionage and infiltration of our government is as serious a threat as external Soviet action.",
    "zh": "不幸的是，近年来我们对共产主义内部威胁的警惕性降低了。对我国政府的间谍活动和渗透与苏联的外部行动一样构成严重威胁。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3776@56/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3776@58/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3776@57/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3776@61/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3776@55/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We've seen some alarming things out of Cuba, but this isn't necessarily a lost cause. Cuba has not declared itself a Communist state and we should be making overtures to prevent that.",
    "zh": "我们在古巴看到了一些令人震惊的事情，但这并不一定是失败的原因。古巴尚未宣布自己是一个共产主义国家，我们应该采取措施阻止这种情况发生。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3777@57/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3777@59/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3777@58/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3777@57/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We will defend our base at Guantanamo and do anything else that is necessary if Cuba continues its hostility. However, it is too early to make a conclusive determination at this point.",
    "zh": "如果古巴继续敌对，我们将保卫我们在关塔那摩的基地，并采取一切必要行动。不过，现在做出结论性决定还为时过早。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3778@58/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3778@60/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3778@59/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3778@58/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "What we've unfortunately seen in Cuba is the consequence of insufficient support for anti-Communist governments and movements. We need to be much more aggressive in our actions against the Castro government.",
    "zh": "我们在古巴不幸地看到的是反共政府和运动支持不足的结果。我们需要对卡斯特罗政府采取更加积极的行动。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3779@59/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3779@61/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3779@60/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3779@59/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We lost a lot of ground diplomatically after this event, and much of that could have been avoided had we issued a formal apology.",
    "zh": "在此事件之后，我们在外交上失去了很多阵地，如果我们发表正式道歉，其中大部分都是可以避免的。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3780@60/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3780@62/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3780@61/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3780@60/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3780@61/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3780@62/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3780@56/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "A formal apology sounds a bit extreme, but we could certainly have expressed our regrets and perhaps saved the Paris Summit from collapse.",
    "zh": "正式道歉听起来有点极端，但我们当然可以表达我们的遗憾，也许可以使巴黎峰会免于崩溃。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3781@61/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3781@63/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3781@62/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3781@61/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3781@62/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3781@63/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3781@57/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Absolutely not. We cannot show weakness in the face of the Soviet threat, and the Paris Summit collapsed from the intransigence of Nikita Khrushchev.",
    "zh": "绝对不是。面对苏联的威胁，我们不能示弱，巴黎峰会也因赫鲁晓夫的顽固不化而破裂。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3782@62/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3782@64/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3782@63/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3782@62/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3782@63/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3782@64/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3782@58/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "He absolutely did, and I would like to see further action to desegregate our schools and enforce our civil rights.",
    "zh": "他绝对做到了，我希望看到进一步的行动来取消我们学校的种族隔离并执行我们的民权。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3783@63/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3783@65/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3783@64/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3783@63/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3783@64/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3783@65/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3783@59/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe that Eisenhower did what he had to do in this case, to make sure the decisions of our Supreme Court are enforced.",
    "zh": "我相信艾森豪威尔在本案中做了他必须做的事情，以确保我们最高法院的判决得到执行。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3784@64/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3784@66/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3784@65/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3784@64/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3784@65/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3784@66/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3784@60/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We should have found a better way to resolve this issue, rather than intrude into the sovereignty of an American state.",
    "zh": "我们应该找到更好的方法来解决这个问题，而不是侵犯美国国家的主权。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3785@65/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3785@67/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3785@66/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3785@65/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3785@66/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3785@67/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3785@61/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need to make sure we don't overextend ourselves into new regions when the situation does not warrant it.",
    "zh": "当情况不允许时，我们需要确保不会过度扩张到新地区。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3790@66/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3790@72/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3790@68/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3790@66/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "This is a situation that we need to watch carefully, and I am open to a variety of measures if necessary.",
    "zh": "这是我们需要仔细观察的情况，如果有必要，我愿意采取各种措施。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3791@67/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3791@73/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3791@69/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3791@67/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe we need to defend South Vietnam at all costs, whatever commitment of our forces that entails.",
    "zh": "我相信我们需要不惜一切代价保卫南越，无论我们的部队做出怎样的承诺。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3792@68/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3792@74/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3792@70/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3792@68/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I would support the use of massive air strikes or tactical nuclear weapons to defend our ally, South Vietnam.",
    "zh": "我支持使用大规模空袭或战术核武器来保卫我们的盟友南越。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3793@69/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3793@75/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3793@71/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3793@69/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Labor unions have been needlessly undermined by the Taft-Hartley Act, and by self-serving investigations from both parties. I will do anything I can as President to support our nation's laborers.",
    "zh": "工会受到《塔夫脱-哈特利法案》和双方自私调查的不必要破坏。作为总统，我将尽我所能来支持我们国家的劳动者。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3794@70/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3794@71/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3794@70/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3794@71/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3794@70/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I support unions and I oppose the excesses of leaders such as Jimmy Hoffa. Unions, cleansed of their corrupt elements, should play a central role in the American economy.",
    "zh": "我支持工会，反对吉米·霍法等领导人的过度行为。清除了腐败分子的工会应该在美国经济中发挥核心作用。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3795@71/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3795@72/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3795@71/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3795@72/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3795@71/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We should be vigilant against labor union excesses, and the Taft-Hartley Act was a good start. I believe that we should keep that law in place.",
    "zh": "我们应该对工会的过度行为保持警惕，《塔夫脱-哈特利法案》是一个良好的开端。我认为我们应该保留该法律。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3796@72/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3796@73/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3796@72/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3796@73/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3796@72/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need to do anything we can to reduce the power of labor unions in this country, including a national right-to-work law.",
    "zh": "我们需要尽一切努力减少工会在这个国家的权力，包括制定国家工作权法律。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3797@73/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3797@74/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3797@73/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3797@74/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3797@73/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I believe that we need more vigilance in the area of defense, for both military equipment and for missile development. We currently have a missile gap with the Soviet Union.",
    "zh": "我认为我们在国防领域需要更加警惕，无论是对于军事装备还是导弹开发。目前我们与苏联在导弹方面存在差距。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3798@74/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3798@76/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3798@75/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3798@74/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3798@75/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3798@72/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3798@74/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We can always find areas for improvement, but we have successfully defended the United States and our allies from numerous Communist threats over the past eight years.",
    "zh": "我们总能找到需要改进的地方，但在过去八年里，我们成功地保卫了美国和我们的盟友免受共产主义的众多威胁。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3799@75/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3799@77/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3799@76/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3799@75/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3799@76/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3799@73/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3799@75/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "In the final analysis, every dollar spent on defense is taken from more productive uses within our economy. I will look for ways to find common ground with the Soviet Union so that we can cut defense spending.",
    "zh": "归根结底，花在国防上的每一美元都来自我们经济中更具生产力的用途。我将寻找与苏联达成共同点的方法，以便我们能够削减国防开支。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3800@76/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3800@78/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3800@77/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3800@76/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3800@77/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3800@74/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3800@76/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We will campaign up and down New York and the Eastern Seaboard.",
    "zh": "我们将在纽约州和东部沿海地区进行战役。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Johnson/answers_json/3801@77/description",
